  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Sickness feels like a strong next choice because my recent interest in Ten Thousand Fists makes me want to explore more Disturbed.",
    "City of Evil, Deftones, and Mezmerize connect with the energetic guitars, atmospheric heaviness, and adventurous rhythms I have been enjoying in Chuck, In Flames, and Tool."
